            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia akagenda amo na Yoramu, mosinto bw’Ahabu, korwania Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, agwo Ramoti o Gileadi. Abasiiria bagaaka Yoramu chingoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Yoramu akairana Yesireeli gochia kogwenigwa chingoma chiria anyorete korwa ase Abasiiria aaria Rama, ekero arwanete na Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria. Ahasia, mosinto o Yehoramu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akagenda korora Yoramu, mosinto bw’Ahabu agwo Yesireeli, ekiagera Yoramu nigo arenge omorwaire.",
          "type": "text",
